msgid "Everything in the file was either new or already matched a persona exactly, so there was nothing to decide. Nothing else changed."
msgstr "Alt i filen var enten nytt eller samsvarte allerede nøyaktig med en persona, så det var ingenting å bestemme. Ingenting annet ble endret."

