msgstr "I denne appen"

#. Explanation of a section of the import review
msgid "In this app each proxy tag belongs to one persona. These members have a tag another persona already has, or that another member of your file has too."
msgstr "I denne appen tilhører hver proxy-tag én persona. Disse medlemmene har en tag som en annen persona allerede har, eller som et annet medlem i filen din også har."

#. Column heading in the table comparing a persona with the import file
msgid "In this app now"
msgstr "I denne appen nå"

#. Column heading in the import review
#. Column heading in the table comparing a persona with the import file
